title: file:duplicate
tags: [[GUI command]] [[File commands]]
kind: reference
summary: Copy a panel's files beside themselves (self / a panel type)

Copies each file the panel designates — the checked ones, else the one under its cursor — beside itself, as `name copy.ext`, then `name copy 2.ext`… A directory is copied with its content. One of the [[File commands]]: `file:duplicate self` in the [[file-manager panel]], the list or the viewer.
